values
('state-of-mind-ai', 'State of Mind AI', 'startup', 'Simplest app to capture employee’s emotional and functional needs', '"State of Mind" is a conversational app built on deep technology that captures employee experiences at 100+ functional and emotional moments across the employee journey, producing analytics that equips managers and HR to get the needed visibility into the evolving needs of employees and craft day-to-day experiences that matter the most.', 'https://stateofmind.ai/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'HRtech', 'Business/Productivity Software', 'Seed', '2020', 'Manoj Kumar, Vivek Chadha', 'IIT Startups', '$15K', 13.00707, 77.60958, 'live'),
('wastelink', 'Wastelink', 'startup', 'Manufacturer of animal feed products using food waste', 'Operator of a food upcycling platform intended to prevent food waste generation. The company''s platform uses processing technology to help food manufacturers manage their surplus and waste by transforming it into nutritional feeds for animals ensuring that food waste stays within the food chain, enabling food producers to get access to a sustainable food-to-feed ecosystem and save on disposal costs.', 'http://www.wastelink.co/', 'Delhi', 'Delhi NCR', 'Agritech', 'Manufacturing', 'Seed', '2018', 'Saket Dave, Krishnan Kasturirangan', 'Matterhorn projects, Indigram labs', '$2.3M', 28.59147, 77.21665, 'live'),
('i-support-farming', 'I Support Farming', 'startup', 'Provider of tech enabled services', 'Developer of Agri-Fintech platform intended to help farmers to achieve micro credits for farming operations. The company''s platform provides end-to-end solutions to small & marginal farmers through phy-digital experience centers called Agro-One, quality of the produce is the key driver to farmers'' success in terms of creating higher demand and better prices for the produce and makes the farmer produce better quality products that suit high-end and quality-conscious buyers, enabling urban people to provide capital for the farmers so that the farmers can carry out their farming activities seamlessly with the inputs from the urban group.', 'http://www.isupportfarming.com/', 'Chennai', 'Tamil Nadu', 'Agritech', 'Farming', 'Seed', '2016', 'Vasant Kumar, Vijayakumar Mani', '10000 Startups, Venture Garage, Atal GreatLakes Balachandran Incubator', '$423K', 13.04959, 80.25289, 'live'),
('head-digital-works', 'Head digital works', 'startup', 'Developer of online casino and gambling games', 'Operator of an online skill-based gaming platform intended to provide distinctive online Rummy experiences to players in India. The company''s gaming platform provides a higher level gaming experience on mobiles, enabling its players to gain informal learning and also improve social interaction and engagements in a playful manner.', 'https://hdworks.in/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Gaming', 'Internet Publishing', 'Series A', '2006', 'Deepak Gullapalli', 'Khattar Group, Samrat Nirmal Zaveri, Rushikesh Kolepaka, Clairvest', '$91M', 17.40333, 78.47939, 'live'),
('nebularc-technologies', 'NebulARC Technologies', 'startup', 'Provider of AI and cloud-based asset tracking and supply chain visibility software', 'Developer of a physical assets visibility platform intended to manage the supply chain process in Logistics,shipping,Retail and warehousing,Pharma etc. NebulARC Technologies can help organizations to run faster and stay more secure while optimizing costs with real-time visibility and analytics on all information-in-motion. NebulARC introduces a unique technology in providing the management teams access to intelligence that makes this possible. NebulARC enable the complete control of goods and assets – when they are in-transit (logistics), at-rest (warehouse and retail) and operations (manufacturing).', 'https://www.nebularc.com/', 'Gurugram', 'Delhi NCR', 'Logistics', 'Information Technology & Services', 'Seed', '2018', 'Alok Sharma, Novita Sharma', 'Turbostart, LogX', '$1M', 28.44725, 77.06754, 'live'),
('farmtheory', 'FarmTheory', 'startup', 'Farmtheory is a B2B agri-tech startup', 'Farmtheory is an innovative agri-waste management startup committed to mitigating waste at its source, empowering farmers to enhance their income, mitigate food loss, and combat climate change.The company''s platform sources flawed produce from farmers and sells it to various restaurants directly, enabling restaurant owners to get farm fresh produce at a low cost which is otherwise healthy to eat but not sold in the market due to irregularity.', 'http://farmtheory.in/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'CropTech, Online Grocery', 'Seed', '2019', 'Arpit Agarwal, Sakshi Agarwal', 'Y Combinator, Merak ventures', '$2.2M', 12.98539, 77.55692, 'live'),
('logic-roots', 'Logic Roots', 'startup', 'Activity based maths learning platform for kids', 'Activity based maths learning platform for kids', 'https://logicroots.com/', 'Jaipur', 'Rajasthan', 'Edtech', 'Education', 'Seed', '2011', 'Kunal Gandhi, Gunjan Agarwal', '', '$580K', 26.88253, 75.80198, 'live'),
('gamerji', 'Gamerji', 'startup', 'Real money based gaming platform', 'Developer of an esports tournament platform intended to offer an online forum where gamers can compete, share content, and win prizes. The company''s platform offers group chat, leaderboard, videos, and gaming profiles, enabling gamers to get a single platform to maintain their gaming statistics.', 'https://www.gamerji.com/', 'Ahmedabad', 'Gujarat', 'Gaming', 'Spectator Sports', 'Seed', '2019', 'Soham Thacker, Valey Patel, Varun Gajjar', '', '$5.81M', 23.019, 72.61128, 'live'),
('bijak', 'Bijak', 'startup', 'B2B trading platform for agricultural commodities', 'Operator of an agricultural trading platform intended to bridge the information asymmetry and lack of accountability in agricultural commodities trading. The company''s platform provides access to transparent pricing, optimizes logistics and helps to improve the working capital cycle, enabling businesses to keep a ledger of their transactions.', 'https://bijak.in/', 'Gurugram', 'Delhi NCR', 'Agritech', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Series B', '2019', 'Nukul Upadhye, Daya Rai, Jitender Bedwal', 'RTP Global, Wellfound, Surge, Alteria Capital', '$34.3M', 28.48749, 77.05608, 'live'),
('crediwatch', 'Crediwatch', 'startup', 'Cloud-based business intelligence solution', 'Crediwatch is a software+data-as-a-service platform company that provides automated & intelligent and a curated data marketplace (consent-based -blockchain architecture) to aid faster and accurate credit decision-making at scale.', 'https://www.crediwatch.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'SaaS', 'Information Services', 'Series A', '2013', 'Meghna Suryakumar, Sandeep Anandampillai', 'Artis Ventures, Astir ventures, Kyto Technology and life sciences', '$5.85M', 12.95972, 77.62474, 'live'),
('smartx-technologies', 'SmartX Technologies', 'startup', 'Provider of IT consulting, software development, infrastructure solutions, and systems integration services', 'In the fields of IT Services, Enterprise software development, and Systems Integration, we offer innovative solutions and services based on our expertise in cloud computing, mobility, data analytics, and artificial intelligence.', 'https://smartxtech.co/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'SaaS', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Pre-seed', '2019', 'Govindaraju Periasamy, Hariram Krishnamoorthy', '', 'Unfunded', 13.01908, 77.64203, 'live'),
('bighaat', 'BigHaat', 'startup', 'Online marketplace platform offering agriculture products', 'Operator of an agricultural products platform intended to bring accessibility of quality agricultural products to farmers at their doorstep. The company offers a broad range of seed, plant protection, plant nutrition, and agri-implements as well as permits various stakeholders of the agri-value chain to come together and build an end-to-end ecosystem for the farming community, enabling farmers to achieve productivity, yield, and income.', 'https://www.bighaat.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'Farming', 'Series C+', '2015', 'Sateesh Nukala, Kiran Vunnam, Raj Kancham, ex-', 'Ankur capital, BlackSoil, Beyond next ventures, VPK Global', '$28.8M', 12.91737, 77.6409, 'live'),
('newtrace', 'NewTrace', 'startup', 'Developer of electrolyzers for green hydrogen generation', 'Newtrace develops batteries and electrolysers for producing green hydrogen for industries. It''s line of electrolyzers is based on a revolutionary new technology offering green hydrogen production at up to 3x lower capex costs. Helps to build businesses that would address sustainable development goals, mitigate climate change and decarbonizes through innovation.', 'https://www.newtrace.io/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Cleantech', 'Renewable Energy Equipment Manufacturing', 'Series A', '2021', 'Prasanta sarkar, Rochan Sinha', 'Peak XV, Aavishkar Capital, Speciale Invest, micelio', '$6.7M', 12.95753, 77.62397, 'live'),
('ninjacart', 'Ninjacart', 'startup', 'Ninjacart is a business-to-business fresh produce supply chain that connects farmers, manufactures, and brands to…', 'Developer of an agricultural marketing and supply chain platform intended to streamline the fresh produce supply chain. The company''s platform leverages data science, infrastructure, and networks to connect farmers directly to businesses and end retailers such as grocery stores as well as allows them to interact with the local manager to meet store-specific needs personally, enabling merchants to source fresh farm produce directly from farmers in less time and in a cost-effective way.', 'http://www.ninjacart.in/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'CropTech, Online Grocery', 'Series C+', '2015', 'Katheeswaran Karandipalayam Kandasamy, Kartheeswaran K K, Ashutosh Vikram, Sachin Jose', 'Accel US, Syngenta Ventures, Neoplux, HR Capital, Trifecta Capital, Jo Hirao, Founder of ZIGExN, Accel India, Nandan Nilekani, Mistletoe,…', '$513M', 12.91929, 77.6322, 'live'),
('intello-labs', 'Intello Labs', 'startup', 'Provider of AI-based solutions for agricultural product quality testing', 'Developer of an analytics tool designed to solve complex problems across the food commodities sector through automated systems that facilitate decision-making. The company''s tools leverage AI, including computer vision and deep learning to build a platform for grading and quality monitoring of agricultural commodities and deliver image-based technologies through smartphone applications, enabling growers, traders, retailers and food service companies to bring transparency and standardization to their quality assessment to reduce value risk and wastage in the agriculture supply chains', 'https://www.intellolabs.com/', 'Gurugram', 'Delhi NCR', 'Agritech', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Series B', '2016', 'Milan Sharma, Ashutosh Kumar, Himani Shah', 'Trifecta capital, VT Capital, THRIVE', '$16.6M', 28.4722, 77.07845, 'live'),
('motiveminds', 'Motiveminds', 'startup', 'Provider of application development, cloud, consulting, and other services', 'A dynamic and growing company that specializes in bringing technology in a human-centric approach to Enterprise Everything.Delivers incredible efficiency and drive business value through complete digitization,automation and intelligent technologies.helping businesses streamline their operations and achieve their goals. It brings together expertise in SAP, Salesforce and Qualtrics, enabling to provide comprehensive services to a wide range of industries.', 'https://motiveminds.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'SaaS', 'Information Technology & Services', 'Seed', '2018', 'Bobby Reddy, Jibin Joseph', 'Lakshmi life sciences', '$460K', 13.02562, 77.55728, 'live'),
('promethean-energy', 'Promethean Energy', 'startup', 'Waste heat recovery products for industrial purposes', 'Developer of waste heat recovery technologies designed to cut down carbon emissions for industrial applications. The company''s technologies develop systems to recover waste heat and reduce fuel consumption across industries such as chemicals, textiles, dairy, food, and hospitality, enabling clients to increase fuel efficiency and reduce carbon footprint.', 'https://prometheanenergy.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'Cleantech', 'Industrial Machinery Manufacturing', 'Seed', '2014', 'Ashwin Krishna, Rajat Agarwal', 'Sangam Ventures', '$488K', 19.06646, 72.88772, 'live'),
('rbdc', 'RBDC', 'startup', 'Data center and hosting services provider', 'Provider of Data center and hosting services. The company offers Tier 3 data centers with over 32000 servers and offer features such as 5IP addresses, free cPanel, Linux or Windows OS with license and KMVoIP. The managed server services include features such as eCommerce hosting, website security and backup, data storage and sharing and support streaming, SaaS, and enterprise solutions', 'https://www.rackbank.com/', 'Indore', 'Madhya Pradesh', 'IT Services', 'IT Services and IT Consultin', '', '2013', 'Narendra Sen', 'IFCI Venture Capital Funds', '$45.5K', 22.67932, 75.90037, 'live'),
('khetigaadi', 'KhetiGaadi', 'startup', 'Online marketplace for buying, selling, and renting tractors and agricultural equipment', 'Developer of agri-eCommerce marketplace dedicated to buying, selling and renting tractors and agricultural equipment. The company''s platform lists new and used tractors as well as financial credit providers to facilitate the purchase of new or used agricultural equipment, enabling farmers, tractor manufacturers, contractors, dealers, brokers, service stations, and agricultural experts to connect with each other and meet their requirements in a hassle-free manner.', 'https://infragaadi.com/', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', 'Agritech', 'Automotive', 'Seed', '2016', 'Pravin Shinde, Vishnu Dhas', '', 'Funding Raised', 18.46544, 73.88068, 'live'),
('wysa', 'Wysa', 'startup', 'AI-enabled coach for mental and emotional wellness', 'AI-enabled coach for mental and emotional wellness. The company provides AI conversational care that guides through both curated CBT programs and on-demand self care through evidence based exercises. The company offers an AI chatbot that uses research backed techniques of cognitive behavioral therapy, dialectical behavior therapy, and meditation to support users with depression, stress, anxiety, sleep, and other mental health and wellness needs. It also, offers features such as a mood tracker, anxiety helper, and mood boosting, and provides coaching services include synchronous live sessions with professionals, text based sessions, and exercises.', 'https://www.wysa.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Healthtech', 'Big Data Analytics & AI', 'Series B', '2015', 'Jo Aggarwal', 'legacy.vn, Nitesh Agarwal', '30.5M', 12.96544, 77.54148, 'live'),
('arya-ai', 'Arya.ai', 'startup', 'Autonomous AI Platform for Financial Institutions to automate and augment', 'Arya ai is an AI Cloud'' for Banks, Insurers and Financial Services to expedite the adoption of AI that is responsible, accurate and auditable.', 'https://arya.ai/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'Fintech', '', 'Seed', '2013', 'Vinay Kumar, Deekshith Marla', 'YourNest, DMI Sparkle Fund', '$2.51M', 19.02522, 72.85893, 'live'),
('stupa-sports-analytics', 'Stupa Sports Analytics', 'startup', 'AI-based sports analytics company, driven by love for the sport', 'Developer of a web-based platform intended to re-imagine and re-design sports via analytics, graphics, real-time stats, auto-replays and predictive analytics. The company offers power to coaches and players to level up their performance with data-driven insights that unlock their strengths, enabling learning from the grassroots to the elite level', 'https://stupaanalytics.com/#/home', 'Delhi', 'Delhi NCR', 'Sports', 'Entertainment Software', 'Series A', '2019', 'Megha Gambhir, Deepak Malik', 'Z47, Angel List, Good capital', '$3.72M.', 28.5801, 77.21154, 'live'),
('aibono', 'Aibono', 'startup', 'Aibono is an end-to-end AGRITECH platform specialised in Aggregation and Just-In-Time Supply of Super Fresh Fruits & Vegetables', 'Provider of AI-powered fresh food aggregator platform. The platform synchronizes real-time production with real-time consumption of fruits and vegetables by using predictive analytics, precision farming, and just-in-time harvests. The solution offered by the company helps the farmer to increase yield, reduce wastage, and also provides insights derived from AI & shared farm intelligence on what to produce and how to produce it.', 'https://www.aibono.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'CropTech, Online Grocery', 'Seed', '2014', 'Vivek Rajkumar', 'Miiliways Ventures, Menterra Venture Advisors, Innoven Capital, Rebright Partners, 3one4 Capital', '$5.48M', 13.02541, 77.57049, 'live'),
('virtual-forest', 'Virtual Forest', 'startup', 'Provider of electronic motor controllers for facility management', 'Provider of electronic motor controllers for facility management. Products include inverter air conditioner (AC) controllers, inverter washing machine controllers, brushless DC ceiling fan controllers, electric vehicle controllers, and solar pump controllers.', 'https://virtualforest.in/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Manufacturing', 'Appliances, Electrical, and Electronics Manufacturing', 'Seed', '2019', 'Gajjannan Palkar, Nazir Tolgi, Omer Basith', 'Napino,GITA', '$668K', 12.93529, 77.57418, 'live'),
('jyosh-ai-solutions', 'JyoSH AI Solutions', 'startup', 'Provider of AI-enabled autonomous robots for cotton cultivation', 'Provider of AI-enabled autonomous robots for cotton cultivation. They offer solutions to enhance the productivity of cotton farmers. It allows users to track cultivation phases, learn about the challenges faced in cotton cultivation such as crop diseases, pests, insects, availability of skilled laborers, etc.', 'https://jyoshrobot.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'Deeptech', 'Robotics Engineering', 'Seed', '2020', 'Sharadchandra Lohokare, Jitendra Ahirrao', 'Pusa Krishi, Venture Center, SINE', '$37.6K', 19.17353, 72.98811, 'live'),
('qpiai', 'QpiAI', 'startup', 'QpiAITM is vertically integrating AI and Quantum technologies in Enterprise solutions, focusing on Tech Agility,…', 'Provider of AI-based quantum model generation platform. These are systems that convert data into intelligence and generates more intelligent information. It provides solutions such as AI modeling and quantum computing. it can be used in life sciences, healthcare, transportation, finance, industrial, space technologies and deploying them at the speed of light.', 'https://qpiai.tech/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Deeptech', 'DeepTech Quantum Computing', 'Seed', '2019', 'Nagendra Nagaraja', 'SIDBI Venutre Capital, YourNest, We Founder Circle', '$6.5M', 12.98652, 77.55683, 'live'),
('neenopal-intelligent-solutions-pvt-ltd', 'NeenOpal Intelligent Solutions Pvt Ltd', 'startup', 'Transforming businesses into thriving data-driven organizations', 'Provider of the business consulting service intended to specialize in data science and business intelligence services. The company provides services across the whole value chain of an organization - digital strategy, sales and marketing, supply chain, and logistics as well as finance and partnering with the clients in their growth journey, providing clients a one-stop system to uniquely fit the ongoing needs.', 'https://www.neenopal.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Business Consulting and Services', 'Pre-seed', '2016', 'Himashu Bahmani, Nished Singhal, Pavel Gupta', 'Amrita TBI', 'Funding Raised', 12.96579, 77.60009, 'live'),
('limechat', 'LimeChat', 'startup', 'LimeChat boosts support and customer satisfaction with AI-powered WhatsApp journeys', 'Provider of AI-based conversational commerce solutions. It provides Whatsapp marketing solutions with features including customer retention, chatbot, marketing campaigns, personalization, cart conversions, and more.', 'https://www.limechat.ai/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'AI', 'Chatbots E-Commerce Enablers', 'Seed', '2020', 'Aniket Bajpai', 'Stellaris Venture Partners, pi Ventures, Groundupp Ventures, Titan Capital, Angel List', '$5.03M', 12.93414, 77.56331, 'live'),
('biofuelcircle', 'BiofuelCircle', 'startup', 'Marketplace for buying and selling biofuels and biomass', 'Operator of a digital platform and rural supply network designed for the bioenergy supply chain. The company connects diverse participants in the bioenergy supply chain, enables a circular economy for agro-waste, generates rural empowerment, and reduces carbon footprint, helping businesses grow by creating new opportunities in the farm-to-fuel ecosystem.', 'https://www.biofuelcircle.com/', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', 'E-commerce', 'Software Development', 'Seed', '2020', 'Suhas Baxi, Ashwin Save', 'Mumbai angels, Better capital, Spectrum impact', '$3.64M', 18.56529, 73.80538, 'live'),
