('ionox-software', 'Ionox Software', 'startup', 'Provider of application development and digital marketing services', 'A Leading IT-Software Company providing services in web applcation,web design,employee tracking,web design and development.', 'https://ionoxsoftware.in/', 'Bhubaneswar', 'Odisha', 'Media & Adtech', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Pre-seed', '2015', '', '', 'Unfunded', 20.27591, 85.79292, 'live'),
('metashop', 'Metashop', 'startup', 'Cloud and AI-based platform for 3D content creation', 'Cloud and AI-based platform for 3D content creation. Its in-house AI pipeline is capable of generating 3D assets of objects, scenarios, and landscapes for businesses. It lets users record a video using a phone, upload it to the MetaShop application, and generate 3D assets at scale.', 'https://metashopai.com/', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', 'AI', 'Technology, Information and Internet', 'Seed', '2022', 'Sophiya Jagannathan, Mukul Ingle', 'Sat Industries, 100X.VC', '$203K', 18.46593, 73.81522, 'live'),
('sensys-technologies', 'Sensys Technologies', 'startup', 'Sensys Technologies is the Developer and Supplier of advance range of Taxation & HR related Software Products & Services', 'Sensys Technologies is an online HRMS and payroll management solutions providing company. Product offerings include EasyPAY.Web (payroll & HRMS solution), AssetExpert (fixed asset management software), EasyTDS (TDS management solution), InstantXBRL (financial statement filing software), and eFormExpert (IT return e-filing software).', 'https://sensysindia.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'HRtech', 'HRTech > HRMS', 'Pre-seed', '2016', 'Praveen Kumar', '', '', 19.0738, 72.92952, 'live'),
('algoshack', 'Algoshack', 'startup', 'A Unified Platform for End to End Test Automation', 'Developer of an intelligent test automation platform designed to transform software delivery by leveraging artificial intelligence and deep technology. The company''s platform significantly helps to develop, build, test, and deploy software, reducing the R&D costs, accelerating time to market, enhancing the quality, productivity and bringing down the business risks, enabling organizations to deliver bug-free software, faster and cheaper, fit-for-purpose and fit-for-use.', 'https://algoshack.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'IT Services', 'IT Services', 'Seed', '2018', 'Budramane Vadeesha, Nalini Vadeesha', 'Ravi Babu Venkatramaiah', '$80K', 12.9378, 77.57125, 'live'),
('string-bio', 'String Bio', 'startup', 'Developer of synthetic biotechnology solutions for waste carbon recycling', 'Developer of synthetic biotechnology solutions for waste carbon recycling. It focuses on the production of high-value products, like feedstocks for the production of high-performance polymers from industrial waste carbon, such as methane and CO2, using metabolically engineered bacteria.It uses its proprietary SIMP (String Integrated Methane platform) that leverages fermentation technology, chemistry and process engineering, and synthetic biology to produce high-quality next-gen ingredients for animal nutrition, agriculture, human nutrition, and personal care sectors—all manufactured using methane as the raw material.', 'https://www.stringbio.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Healthtech', 'Biotechnology Research', 'Series B', '2012', 'Ezhil Subbian, Vinod ML Kumar', 'Seventure Partner, Ankur Capital, ONGC', '$20M', 12.94758, 77.64237, 'live'),
('wegot', 'WEGoT', 'startup', 'Provider of water management solutions', 'Developer of a water management system designed for real-time monitoring of water usage. The company''s platform utilizes high-precision Internet of Things-enabled ultrasonic sensors to capture data at every point of a building''s water infrastructure, and present this data to users through mobile and desktop applications, enabling building managers to identify leaks, monitor consumption, and implement sustainable water practices.', 'http://www.wegot.in/', 'Chennai', 'Tamil Nadu', 'Consumer', 'Utilities', 'Series A', '2015', 'Abhilash Haridass, Mohideen Haja', 'Gruhas, GoFrugal Technologies, Brigade group', '$5.02M', 13.0606, 80.27312, 'live'),
('supergaming', 'SuperGaming', 'startup', 'SuperGaming is a company that develops and publishes innovative, socially engaging games for mobile and PC platforms', 'Developer of mobile-based casual games', 'https://www.supergaming.com/', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', 'Gaming', 'Computer Games', 'Seed', '2017', 'Roby John, Avinash Pandey, Navneet Waraich', 'AET Fund, Dream Incubator, Skycatcher, BAce Capital, 1Up Ventures, Better Capital', '$6.8M', 18.53078, 73.83977, 'live'),
('zodhya', 'Zodhya', 'startup', 'Provider of energy optimization solutions for commercial spaces', 'Provider of energy optimization solutions for commercial spaces. It offers solutions such as analyzing power usage, maintenance of equipment with repair and replacement options for equipment, and providing reports of ways to improve the energy consumption of the building. It delivers real-time data on energy consumption through IoT-based devices.', 'https://www.zodhyatech.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Cleantech', 'Renewable Energy Semiconductor Manufacturing', 'Seed', '2017', 'Rohith Palleria, Adityanath Dandabthina, Sharathmani Chinnasetti', 'Rainmatter', '$113K', 17.41428, 78.46979, 'live'),
('flytta', 'Flytta', 'startup', 'Cloud-based platform providing relocation services for enterprises', 'Flytta is a cloud-based platform providing relocation services for enterprises. It provides moving, packing, airport transfer, short stay, storage, relocation, and doorstep deliveries of office supplies, furniture, and equipment for employees and organizations. Its relocation management software includes features like budgeting, delivery tracking, forecasting, and planning, as well as HRMS and ATS integrations', 'https://goflytta.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Logistics', 'Transportation, Logistics, Supply Chain and Storage', 'Seed', '2016', 'Rahul Kanuganto, Gokulavasan Murali', 'Corvus ventures, Dorado corporation', '$940K', 17.38152, 78.42641, 'live'),
('cognine', 'Cognine', 'startup', 'Provider of IT service suite solutions', 'Cognine specializes in delivering bespoke software development, IT consulting, and cybersecurity services to businesses worldwide.Cognine is a dynamic and innovative IT company known for its cutting-edge solutions in the realm of technology and digital transformation. It is distinguished by its commitment to leveraging emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, and blockchain to address complex business challenges. The company prides itself on fostering a culture of continuous learning and adaptation, ensuring its solutions are always at the forefront of technological advancements.', 'https://cognine.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'IT Services', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Pre-seed', '2018', '', '', 'Unfunded', 17.43528, 78.4354, 'live'),
