('zupee', 'Zupee', 'startup', 'Online platform for playing money-winning games', 'Online platform for playing money-winning games', 'https://www.zupee.com/', 'Gurugram', 'Delhi NCR', 'Gaming', 'Entertainment Providers', 'Series B', '2018', 'Dilsher Singh Malhi, Siddhant Saurabh', 'WestCap, Nepean Capital,Smile, AJ Capital, Alpha Wave Global', '$122M', 28.51419, 77.05644, 'live'),
('svaya-robot-ics', 'Svaya Robot:ics', 'startup', 'Offers collaborative robots for industrial automation purposes', 'Svaya Robotics specializes in manufacturing and supplying collaborative robots, designing user-friendly Cobots for the manufacturing sector.The features include a UI/UX that enables workers to teach and interact with the robot, adapting to the context and also augment human ability. These robots are completely software driven and are easy to deploy in any setup. Our cobots are engineered for various industries like automotive, consumer durables, healthcare, food, pharmaceuticals, warehouse logistics etc., and can be used by any SME or large companies for edge-tasks.', 'https://svayarobotics.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Manufacturing', 'Automation Machinery Manufacturing', 'Pre-seed', '2018', 'Vijay R Seelam', '', 'Unfunded', 17.40931, 78.45103, 'live'),
('blubirch', 'Blubirch', 'startup', 'Platform offering SaaS-based reverse logistics solutions for businesses', 'Platform offering SaaS-based reverse logistics solutions for businesses. It offers end-to-end reverse logistics solutions to maximize recovery from returned, unsold, and unused technology assets for retailers, OEMs/ODMs, and enterprises. The range of services includes asset life cycle management, asset buyback, procurement, refurbishment, and rental services among others. It also offers customized workflow to meet business requirements and also remove low-value-added tasks.', 'https://www.blubirch.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Software Development', 'Series A', '2015', 'Sapan Jain, Amit Goel, Jeby Cherian', 'Cornerstone venture, Chicago venture, Capital 2B', '$13.7M', 12.92029, 77.61926, 'live'),
