('kroop-ai', 'Kroop AI', 'startup', 'Kroop AI develops an audio-visual deep learning platform that allows for the creation and detection of synthetic media…', 'AI-based solutions for deep fake detection. The features of the product include real-time analysis and detection, analysis and visualization of video content on dashboards, multi-layered detection, identification of malicious content, API integration, etc.', 'https://kroop.ai/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Edtech', 'Video Creation Tools Cybersecurity', 'Seed', '2021', 'Jyoti Joshi Dhall', 'Seed Cap Consultancy, Anikarth Ventures, LetsVenture, Concept Communication, 100x.vc', '$230K', 13.02614, 77.6321, 'live'),
('ati-motors', 'Ati Motors', 'startup', 'Developer of autonomous electric cargo vehicles for material handling and picking', 'Ati Motors specializes in electric autonomous robots for cargo transport that have been deployed in the real world, in factories and warehouses. The company takes pride in designing robots that fit into existing infrastructures, indoors and outdoors, with robust mechanical systems, reliable electronics and advanced automation softwares. Their flagship robot, Sherpa Tug, autonomously pulls multiple trolleys with a 1,000 kg payload, featuring a swappable battery for an 8-hour operation', 'http://www.atimotors.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Industrial Automation', 'Series A', '2017', 'Saurabh Chandra, Vinay V', 'True Ventures, Athera, Blume ventures, Exfinity Venture', '$15.4M', 12.98818, 77.64886, 'live'),
('anscer-robotics', 'ANSCER Robotics', 'startup', 'Provider of robotic solutions for warehouse operations', 'Provider of robotic solutions for warehouse operations. Its product offering includes autonomous mobile robots like AR 250, AR 650, and AR 1250, and automated guided vehicles for payload logistics. It also offers an intelligence engine for people to develop their own AMR.', 'https://www.anscer.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Industrial Automation', 'Seed', '2020', 'Ribin Mathew, Ebin Sunny, Raghu Venkatesh', 'Geninfy Robotics Labs, IKP EDEN, BIRAC', '$350K', 13.02204, 77.60391, 'live'),
