('aquaconnect', 'Aquaconnect', 'startup', 'Provider of AI-based end-to-end solutions for shrimp and fish farmers', 'Developerf of an aquaculture platform designed to assist shrimp and fish farmers. The company''s platform uses AI and satellite remote sensing technologies to capture pond data to provide data-driven farm advisory to help farmers improve their farm productivity, uses deep learning to provide context-aware alerts and suggestions to improve water quality, aquatic health and optimize feed consumption, enabling farmers to improve market linkage certainty and increase value realization.', 'https://aquaconnect.blue/', 'Chennai', 'Tamil Nadu', 'Agritech', 'Fisheries', 'Series A', '2017', 'Rajamanohar Somasundaram, Shanmuga Sundararaj Subramaniam, Sanjai Kumar', 'S2G Ventures, Lok Capital, Rebright partners, Flourish', '$24.1M', 13.06983, 80.2915, 'live'),
